@startuml Feature Flags Flow - Clubinho NIB API
!theme plain
hide footbox
title Feature flags — resolve and manage

actor Client
participant FeatureFlagsController as Controller
participant GetFeatureFlagsService as Reader
participant "Create / Update / Delete services" as Writer
database "MySQL\nFeatureFlagsRepository" as Repository

alt Public map or check
  Client -> Controller : GET /feature-flags/map or /check/:key
  Controller -> Reader : resolve flag(s) for session role
  Reader -> Repository : load persisted flags
  Repository --> Reader : enabled + targetRoles
  Reader --> Client : enabled only when flag and audience match
else Admin management
  Client -> Controller : CRUD /feature-flags
  Controller -> Writer : validated DTO / key
  Writer -> Repository : create, update, toggle or delete
  Writer -> Reader : invalidate affected cache
  Writer --> Client : DTO or 204
end

note over Writer, Repository
  Module startup synchronizes default flags and removes retired keys.
end note
@enduml
